## Coding Standards

### Python Style
- Follow PEP 8
- Use type hints for all functions
- Use Pydantic for data validation
- Use async/await for I/O operations

### Database
- Use SQLAlchemy 2.0 declarative models
- All models in `src/database/models/`
- All queries through service layer
- Use transactions for multi-step operations

### Telegram Bot
- All handlers async
- Use inline keyboards for interactions
- Update messages instead of sending new ones
- Handle all errors gracefully

### Testing
- Use pytest
- TDD approach (write tests first)
- Minimum 80% code coverage
- Test all handlers and services

