## Environment Variables

### Required
```bash
# Telegram
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token
TELEGRAM_SUPPLIER_BOT_TOKEN=your_supplier_bot_token

# Database
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./database.db

# Pay2S (already configured)
PAY2S_ENDPOINT=https://sandbox-payment.pay2s.vn/v1/gateway/api/create
PAY2S_PARTNER_CODE=your_partner_code
PAY2S_ACCESS_KEY=your_access_key
PAY2S_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key

# IPN
IPN_HOST=0.0.0.0
IPN_PORT=5001
IPN_URL=https://your-domain.com/ipn
```

### Optional
```bash
# Redis
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# Dashboard
DASHBOARD_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key
DASHBOARD_PORT=5002

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
```

